#AREA Tsarian Rock~
#AUTHORS Blythe~
#RANGES 5 25 1 99
#RESETMSG Cheap! Cheep! MEEEEEOOOOOOWWW! SQUAWK!!! MMmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm!~
#FLAGS AFLAG_NODEBUG|AFLAG_NOCASTLE|AFLAG_NOTELEPORT

#HELPS
-1 TSARIANHQ~

Tsarian Rock

Tsarian Rock is the home of the Tsarian Army Head Quarters.
It is located south of Chakkor off the roads of the realm.

To join the army and achieve some status in the Tsarian Army, it
is recommended that one does the quest that the Tsarian General
gives.

This area was created by Blythe and was last updated 25th April 1999.

(a) Blythe

{a}BLYTHE
~
0$~


#MOBILES
#14300
ethereal guard ~
ethereal guard~
ethereal guard for rooms 11 12 14 and 15.~
ethereal guard~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND|AFF_ETHEREAL 0 S
1 0 0 10d10+10000 10d10+100
10000 RACE_HUMAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if race($n) != 11
  mpechoat $n {140}You are not welcome at Tsarian Rock.{300}
  mpechoaround $n $n is not welcome at Tsarian Rock!
  mpechoaround $n screams with pain as they are slapped out of the rock
  mpechoaround $n by a giant cat paw.
  mptransfer $n 9755
  mpat 9755 mpecho $n narrowly escaped being the cats dinner!
endif
~
|
