#14302
tsarian guard ~
a Tsarian guard~
A Tsarian Guard stands at attention here.~
The guard has light yellow spotted fur coat.  He is a tall graceful
and slender humanoid feline.  She has a long tail, paws with long
claws and a cat like face.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
20 0 0 1d1+300 1d1+20
10000 RACE_TSARIAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
>all_greet_prog 50~
if race($n) == 8
  shout MMMMmmmmmmmm LUNCH!!!
  mpkill $n
  mpmset $n long (Cat's Lunch) $n is here.
endif
~
>death_prog 20~
mpoload 14301
mpecho The Guard coughs up a furball as he dies.
~
|
#14303
tsarian armourer~
The Tsarian Armourer~
The Tsarian Armourer repairs some leather armour here.~
He has a dark orange spotted fur coat.  His head is that of a cat
and his body is that of a fur covered humanoid.  He is dressed
in light weight armour. ~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
1 0 0 10d10+10000 10d10+100
10000 RACE_TSARIAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#14304
tsarian witch~
The Tsarian Witch~
The Tsarian Witch mixes a potion here.~
She has the palest golden fur with light grey spots.  She is wearing
long golden robes that shimmer and show her lithe humanoid body
to advantage.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
1 0 0 10d10+10000 10d10+100
10000 RACE_TSARIAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_FEMALE
#14305
tsarian barman~
The Tsarian Barman~
The Tsarian Barman pours you a drink.~
Sporting fur of a dark red brown with large black spots he is the biggest
Tsarian you have ever seen.  He wears a light weight armour with a name
plate attatched to it.  Looking closer at the name plate you read the
word "Tiny".  It seems someone has a sense of humour.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
1 0 0 10d10+10000 10d10+100
10000 RACE_TSARIAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
#14306
tsarian general~
The Tsarian General~
The Tsarian General studies maps here.~
He stands tall and lithe wearing full leather armour.  His fur is a 
burnt orange with darker orange spots.  He has piercing green cat eyes.
If you are in the Tsarian Army perhaps you could ask him about any
PROMOTIONs that you may deserve.~
ACT_SMART|ACT_BODY|ACT_RACE|ACT_SENTINEL AFF_TONGUES|AFF_UNDERSTAND 0 S
95 0 0 10d10+10000 10d10+100
10000 RACE_TSARIAN
POS_STANDING POS_STANDING SEX_MALE
>all_greet_prog 100~
if race($n) == 11
  if quest(0, 5, $n) == 0
    say Greetings $n.  Could I interest you in joining
    say the Tsarian Army?
  else
    if quest(0, 5, $n) == 6
      say Ahhh good you have cleared out those terrible birds.
      say You are more than welcome to join our ranks.
      mpechoat $n To join type the following:
      mpechoat $n army join <password>
      mpmset $n quest 0 5 7
      say At any time you make come back to
      say if you have achieved PROMOTION in our ranks.
      mpmset $n long (Private) $n of the Tsarian Army is here.
      mpquiet on
      mpforce $n drop i14300
      sac i14300
      mpquiet off
    else
      if quest(0, 5, $n) < 6
        if quest(0, 5, $n) > 1
          say Go Back!  I can still hear the dreadful
          say sqwarking of all those birds above the rock!
        endif
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog yes~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 0
  if race($n) == 11
    say First $n you have to proove you are worthy of us.
    say We have an infestation of birds in the forest
    say above our rock.  Clean them out.
    mpoload 14300
    give papers $n
    say Keep these papers with you at ALL times.
    say It will show my men that you are a
    say a possibility for our army and not kick
    say out of the rock.
    say Keep them in plain view all the time.
    mpmset $n quest 0 5 1
    mpmset $n long (Tsarian Army Trainee) $n is here.
  endif
endif
~
>speech_prog promotion promotions~
if quest(0, 5, $n) == 7
  if level($n) > 89
    say You have achieved the rank of General in our army.
    mpechoat $n The general gives you nod of respect.
    mpmset $n long (General) $n of the Tsarian Army is here.
  else
    if level($n) > 70
      say You have achieved the rank of Captain in our army.
      mpmset $n long (Captain) $n of the Tsarian Army is here.
    else
      if level($n) > 45
        say You have achieved the rank of Leutenient in our army.
        mpmset $n long (Leutenient) $n of the Tsarian Army is here.
      else
        say You are still a Private $n.
        say Keep fighting the battle.
      endif
    endif
  endif
endif
~ 
>speech_prog retire resign~
say I am saddened that you feel the need to leave our ranks.
say But you have served us well $n.
mpmset $n long (Retired) $n of the Mighty Tsarian Army is here.
mpmset $n quest 0 5 8
mpechoat $n To resign from the army type the following:
mpechoat $n army retire <password>
~
>death_prog 1~
mpoload 14313
~
|
