#ROOMS
#14300
Tsarian Rock~
The walls are etched with paintings depicting famous legendary Tsarian
fighters in battle.  There is a large sign in the center of the cave.
The floor is a soft sand and apart from the clank of your armour your
footsteps are quiet.~
143 ROOM_NO_MOB SECT_UNDER_GROUND
DDIR_EAST
~
~
0 -1 14314
DDIR_WEST
~
~
0 -1 17238
S
#14301
Up in the trees~
Sunlight filters through the leaves.  In a branch is a large nest.
In the nest are five large spotted eggs.  One of them is wobbling
from side to side.  On the edge of the nest is a few squirming
worms.  Perhaps they are dinner for the expected hatchlings?~
143 0 SECT_FOREST
DDIR_DOWN
~
~
0 -1 14306
S
#14302
Up in the trees~
You are high up above the ground.  You look down and are grateful
for the fact that you have nine lives.  You hope that you are not
on your ninth right now!  There is a large nest on the branch
nearest you.~
143 0 SECT_FOREST
DDIR_DOWN
~
~
0 -1 14307
S
#14303
Up in the trees~
You peer through the branches to see a large nest.  In the nest are two
eggs.  One is cracked and you can see a small moist beak breaking through
the shell.  The eggs lie in a bed of fur.  Soft fur.  As you look closer
you realise it is cat fur!~
143 0 SECT_FOREST
DDIR_DOWN
~
~
0 -1 14308
S
#14304
Up in the trees~
You see the biggest nest that you have ever seen.  Eight large spotted
eggs fill it to almost overflowing.  They nestle on a bed of fur, hair
and feathers.  As you watch one of the shells breaks open and you see the
moist feathered head of a baby bird.  Mmmmm Lunch!~
143 0 SECT_FOREST
DDIR_DOWN
~
~
0 -1 14309
S
#14305
Up in the trees~
A large nest is in the crook of two branches.  In it are three large
baby birds.  They cheep at you expectantly.  The nest is comfortably
lined with soft feathers, even softer fur, and soft human hair.  The
mother bird cannot be too far away.~
143 0 SECT_FOREST
DDIR_DOWN
~
