#14316
Tsarian Rock Central~
You stand in the centre of a large cave.  Above you is a steep ramp leading
to the cave above, and below is a ramp leading to the sleeping quarters.
In each direction you see the entrances to four caves.  There is a painted
wooden sign over the entrance to each cave.  To your north a sign says "The
Cats Claw", to your south "The Furball Cafe", to your west "Catnip and
Potions" and finally to your east you see a sign with a large military
Tsarnian on it.~
